of HE4, CA125, risk of ovarian malignancy algorithm (ROMA) and risk of malignancy index (RMI) as diagnostic tools of 
epithelial ovarian cancer in patients with a pelvic mass", "decision": "INCLUDE", "rationale": "Prospective pelvic mass 
