│ "Women\'s experiences with ovarian cancer: reflections on being diagnosed", "abstract": "The purpose of this         │
│ qualitative study was to describe the perspectives of women living with ovarian cancer about their experiences with  │
│ diagnosis, treatment, and follow-up care. A convenience sample of 18 women was interviewed using an open-ended       │
